# Vendored React/ReactDOM are loaded with Subresource Integrity: dc-runtime
# pins a sha384 of each file and the browser refuses to execute anything that
# does not hash to it. Line-ending normalisation rewrites bytes, which breaks
# that hash and leaves the page unable to render. Never convert these.
assets/vendor/** -text

# Generated by build.mjs and committed for GitHub Pages. Keep byte-for-byte
# identical to what the build emits, so a rebuild shows a clean diff.
assets/dc-runtime.js -text
index.html -text
